{"4129430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Poly Plaza 2", "steam_appid": 4129430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poly Plaza 2 is an open-world business RPG where idle game progression meets total freedom. Start with nothing and build a massive property empire in a modern city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy Properties for Passive Income</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your money to buy properties that earn rental income automatically. Watch your wealth grow as you buy more properties. Go from owning one apartment to controlling entire city blocks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the City for Rare Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find valuable resources, hidden opportunities, and profitable deals throughout a massive realistic city. Collect resources and sell them. The city is full of opportunities for those who explore.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poly Plaza 2 is an open-world business RPG where idle game progression meets total freedom. Start with nothing and build a massive property empire in a modern city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy Properties for Passive Income</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your money to buy properties that earn rental income automatically. Watch your wealth grow as you buy more properties. Go from owning one apartment to controlling entire city blocks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the City for Rare Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find valuable resources, hidden opportunities, and profitable deals throughout a massive realistic city. Collect resources and sell them. The city is full of opportunities for those who explore.</p>", "short_description": "An open world idle tycoon rpg about making money.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129430/cf2cc5a62075141a2809d16b